      "description": "This scenario is a test case designed to validate data-extraction workflows that rely on the `message_chunk` node.\nThe node exposes a rich set of *chunker* options that let you:\n\n1. **Split long messages into manageable chunks** (by length, sentence, paragraph, etc.).\n2. **Apply a regular-expression filter** so that only the text fragments relevant to subsequent steps are retained.\n\nIn short, a scenario demonstrates both message segmentation *and* targeted extraction, providing a concise dataset for the rest of the job pipeline.\n\n---\n\n### Sample Lorem-Ipsum text containing a few URLs\n\nLorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Visit **[https://example.org/docs](https://example.org/docs)** for the full documentation; for troubleshooting tips, see **[http://help.example.com/faq](http://help.example.com/faq)**.\nSed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua. Check out our blog at **[https://blog.example.net](https://blog.example.net)** for updates. Ut enim ad minim veniam, quis nostrud exercitation ullamco laboris nisi ut aliquip ex ea commodo consequat.\n",
